  clock: 5  # 4919
  nonce: '4919'  # 4919
  message: "Done — merged PR #644 (7fa9e84e5e), ADR-0042. Every --input consumer routes through load_substrate, which now warns to stderr when the loaded file uses a legacy survey basename (hypergumbo.results.json / hg.json / bm.json / behavior_map.json, incl. .gz) — naming the alias found + canonical survey.json — while still loading it. BEHAVIORAL REPRO (live): `hypergumbo search f --input <bm.json>` -> exit 0 + stderr \"Warning: <path>/bm.json: 'bm.json' is a deprecated survey filename (ADR-0042); rename to 'survey.json'. The legacy aliases are accepted for one minor version, then removed.\" New _warn_if_legacy_survey_name helper (strips a trailing .gz) called once after a successful parse in load_substrate — the single read chokepoint for explicit --input and auto-discovered paths. 1526 tests / 100% coverage on changed files. Alias removal at window-close is a separate follow-up."  # 4919
